{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This relaxing first-person puzzle game has you between rooms and your objective is to get rid of the extra items.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One side contains extra items, compare it with the other rooms to tell what is out of place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to make as little mistakes as possible, time does not matter only the mistakes made are counted. Your score for a level is measured by stars, you will have to be careful to get three stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are eight levels handcrafted with every item layout premade and randomly determined each play.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Starting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/c9359cb0f024c62e5cb08dab64a4172f7dbf529a.jpg"},{"name":"LV1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/794a7d404ce83ff5ec095ae121988f719bc7a0ca.jpg"},{"name":"LV2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/ac774f52ee43a0e722ab94f3e55f536abeab8501.jpg"},{"name":"LV3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/4c14c179b58fff8c033c9ebd4b84046d7f2e166d.jpg"},{"name":"LV4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/efafe20d84ce828e505c6342b2bcf0a8e8efda79.jpg"},{"name":"LV5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/4654ad6a1257b25d58d2ddb2351287b2a934ee67.jpg"},{"name":"LV6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/cb05335e90f06af91ac4858b6db6237db69c738f.jpg"},{"name":"LV7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/6d40c00ef3fab07124cd897376d94772d15deb84.jpg"},{"name":"LV8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591080/f8cc6a1f95dd8faaa7dbde13efc9bc796200